			"notes": "## New Features & Changes\n### New Features\n- Automatically subdivides scan queries for faster, more thorough player discovery on large servers. (Theoretical maximum of 2.14 billion player names!) \n- Reduced minimum scan interval.\n- Hide button disabled during TabScan to prevents getting stuck in inventory screen when you minimized the GUI while scanning.\n- Excluded players hidden from online list.\n\n<img width=\"40%\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a5b54d3-f7f6-44ac-af5c-bc3ea11a63cb\" />\n\n### Changes\n- Fixed a bug where you can't click or interact with the creative mode inventory menu.\n- Migrated build system to Stonecutter for multi-version support.\n- Simplified version compatibility layer.\n- Code cleanup and optimization.\n\n\n**For Minecraft Fabric 1.21.1 to 1.21.11**"
		},
